WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:05.740
Ladies and gentlemen, I must ask
you to contemplate something.

00:05.740 --> 00:08.450
What is the greatest beverage in the world?

00:08.450 --> 00:10.780
What could it be?

00:11.080 --> 00:11.780
Water?

00:12.300 --> 00:13.080
Juice?

00:13.080 --> 00:13.810
Black tea?

00:13.810 --> 00:14.610
Milk?

00:14.610 --> 00:15.650
Sake?

00:15.650 --> 00:16.530
Which is it?

00:17.850 --> 00:20.290
Do you need some time to answer?

00:20.290 --> 00:21.210
All right.

00:21.210 --> 00:22.990
Take your time.

00:22.990 --> 00:26.290
What is the greatest beverage in the world?

00:26.290 --> 00:28.640
Think it over.

00:29.420 --> 00:31.110
Is that what you expected me to say?

00:31.110 --> 00:33.170
The answer is coffee!

00:33.620 --> 00:34.800
There's nothing to contemplate.

00:34.800 --> 00:37.060
What is there to contemplate? Get a grip.

00:37.060 --> 00:38.240
Coffee is the most delicious.

00:38.240 --> 00:40.160
Coffee is the greatest.

00:40.160 --> 00:41.990
"I don't know, I mean, coffee?"

00:41.990 --> 00:45.650
If that's you, fool, you're
drinking coffee from now on!

00:49.050 --> 00:51.820
It was several months ago
that I became a CaffeineLoid.

00:52.300 --> 00:55.900
I was stunned by a cup of coffee
served to me by the girl.

01:00.470 --> 01:02.980
Its seductive aroma, its soft flavor...

01:02.980 --> 01:05.620
One sip is enough to inspire.

01:06.090 --> 01:08.630
It stirs a passionate desire for creativity.

01:09.630 --> 01:11.500
And it is picturesque.

01:11.920 --> 01:16.180
This angle, and this angle...

01:17.330 --> 01:20.680
Of course, I am picturesque
even without coffee.

01:23.480 --> 01:25.880
Coffee is fascinating indeed.

01:25.880 --> 01:28.230
There are multiple steps
leading to its completion.

01:28.230 --> 01:31.650
Any minor change transforms its taste.

01:32.320 --> 01:34.930
The beans are of particular importance.

01:34.930 --> 01:36.880
The higher their quality,
the higher the price.

01:36.880 --> 01:39.490
But I shall demonstrate to you a
convenient way to acquire them.

01:40.870 --> 01:42.700
Why are we buying <i>that</i> one?

01:42.960 --> 01:44.950
That one's expensive.

01:46.730 --> 01:47.710
Nope.

01:49.250 --> 01:49.830
No.

01:51.270 --> 01:52.170
I said, "no."

01:53.950 --> 01:55.340
Don't look at me like that.

01:55.980 --> 01:57.030
The power glare.

01:57.840 --> 01:59.870
It makes possible the impossible.

01:59.870 --> 02:00.970
Keep that in mind.

02:02.180 --> 02:04.640
With the beans in your possession,
we move on to grinding.

02:04.890 --> 02:07.270
What is crucial here is the number of beans.

02:07.270 --> 02:10.230
How many beans should be used per cup?

02:10.590 --> 02:12.060
I have tested.

02:13.410 --> 02:14.400
And tested.

02:14.600 --> 02:15.570
And tested.

02:15.660 --> 02:16.540
And tested.

02:16.680 --> 02:17.470
And tested.

02:17.600 --> 02:18.320
And tested.

02:18.880 --> 02:22.790
And at last, I have divined
God's Bean Coefficient.

02:23.740 --> 02:26.580
Yes!

02:28.240 --> 02:30.040
How many beans is that, you ask?

02:31.130 --> 02:32.840
I took great pains to find it.

02:32.840 --> 02:35.200
I can't divulge it so casually.

02:35.200 --> 02:36.430
It's 60 beans!

02:36.430 --> 02:37.070
Sixty!

02:37.250 --> 02:37.920
Sixty!

02:38.170 --> 02:39.800
Sixty!

04:14.650 --> 04:15.990
The ideal bean.

04:15.990 --> 04:17.300
God's Bean Coefficient.

04:17.300 --> 04:19.040
Having acquired these two factors,

04:19.040 --> 04:22.380
I will finally experience
this ultimate flavor.

04:20.110 --> 04:23.280
22: A Discerning Man

04:23.280 --> 04:24.230
Good.

04:24.230 --> 04:27.030
I shall now count 40 beans.

04:27.030 --> 04:29.620
Shouldn't it be 60, you ask?

04:30.280 --> 04:32.060
You remember well.

04:32.060 --> 04:33.040
You pass.

04:35.740 --> 04:37.360
Be silent as I count.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.040
This isn't a game.

04:40.550 --> 04:41.460
One.

04:42.330 --> 04:43.450
Two.

04:44.570 --> 04:45.540
Three.

04:46.790 --> 04:47.730
Four.

04:49.090 --> 04:49.850
Five.

04:53.100 --> 04:54.350
Six.

04:54.770 --> 04:55.760
Seven.

04:56.310 --> 04:57.290
Eight.

05:01.870 --> 05:03.340
Nine.

05:03.970 --> 05:05.490
Ten.

05:07.570 --> 05:10.370
One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.360
Very well.

05:12.810 --> 05:14.430
Eleven.

05:15.800 --> 05:17.880
I'm home.

05:18.310 --> 05:20.950
Liszt-chan is home.

05:20.950 --> 05:22.300
I'm home.

05:24.530 --> 05:25.800
My, who's this?

05:25.800 --> 05:27.170
Such a handsome man.

05:27.590 --> 05:28.430
Or not.

05:28.750 --> 05:30.450
Who the hell are you?

05:30.450 --> 05:31.840
What do you think you're looking at?

05:31.840 --> 05:34.100
You have to pay to check this out, jackass.

05:34.890 --> 05:37.100
Bring me water...

05:37.280 --> 05:38.880
Water.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.950
Eleven.

05:41.950 --> 05:43.110
Twelve.

05:43.350 --> 05:44.690
Thirteen.

05:45.190 --> 05:45.710
Fourt—

05:45.710 --> 05:48.300
Why aren't you answering me?

05:48.670 --> 05:50.740
Shut up.

05:51.790 --> 05:53.740
What's this? Is it tasty?

05:53.740 --> 05:55.370
Take a bite.

05:55.650 --> 05:56.420
How is it?

05:56.420 --> 05:57.660
Yummy?

05:58.190 --> 05:58.820
Well?

05:58.820 --> 05:59.800
Tell me.

06:06.320 --> 06:08.050
I feel gross.

06:08.050 --> 06:08.630
I'm puking.

06:10.920 --> 06:11.850
Don't touch me!

06:11.850 --> 06:12.440
Chop!

06:12.600 --> 06:13.460
Chop!

06:13.600 --> 06:15.150
Chop!

06:17.390 --> 06:19.130
I'm sorry.

06:19.130 --> 06:22.360
I don't get so drunk, usually.

06:22.360 --> 06:25.380
Thanks for caring about me.

06:33.520 --> 06:34.330
One.

06:35.390 --> 06:36.450
Two.

06:37.090 --> 06:38.260
Three.

06:38.750 --> 06:39.290
Four.

06:39.290 --> 06:40.000
Whatcha doin'?

06:40.810 --> 06:42.510
Hey, are you making coffee?

06:42.510 --> 06:44.000
Nice, I'll have some.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.550
Let me do it.

06:45.550 --> 06:47.090
Don't touch me, Wolf.

06:47.590 --> 06:48.740
Come on.

06:48.740 --> 06:50.430
I'll make you some, too.

06:50.430 --> 06:51.230
No, no thanks.

06:51.230 --> 06:53.760
Wait, how many beans do you use again?

06:53.760 --> 06:55.530
I said, "No thanks!"

06:55.530 --> 06:57.200
Fifty beans? A hundred?

06:57.200 --> 06:59.640
Oh, like it matters, right?

07:00.570 --> 07:02.060
Be gone!

07:02.280 --> 07:03.140
You!

07:03.140 --> 07:04.960
What do you think you're doing?

07:04.960 --> 07:06.190
Get off of Senpai.

07:06.450 --> 07:08.680
Morning, Parappa the Kitepa.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.820
The who?

07:09.820 --> 07:10.900
Give that to me.

07:11.180 --> 07:13.190
Good morning, Senpai.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.830
I'll make your coffee.

07:14.830 --> 07:15.650
No. Don't.

07:15.650 --> 07:17.560
I'll do it, Parappa the Kitepa.

07:17.560 --> 07:18.570
I shall do it.

07:18.570 --> 07:19.910
It's fine, Schubert-kun.

07:20.140 --> 07:23.110
So how do you make coffee, again?

07:23.110 --> 07:23.650
See?

07:23.650 --> 07:24.470
I told you, it's fine.

07:24.470 --> 07:25.670
Give it back.

07:25.670 --> 07:27.470
You're much too crude for that.

07:27.470 --> 07:30.120
Says you! You look like a dork.

07:30.120 --> 07:30.960
Just give it to me.

07:30.960 --> 07:33.860
Please, listen to me, both of you.

07:33.860 --> 07:35.440
I want to do it myself.

07:35.440 --> 07:36.680
Give me the bag.

07:36.810 --> 07:37.430
Give me the bag.

07:42.640 --> 07:44.860
Don't get in my way again, do you hear?

07:44.860 --> 07:47.020
The next time you do,

07:47.420 --> 07:50.670
I will have you both become coffee.

07:52.750 --> 07:54.300
Be silent.

08:00.040 --> 08:02.050
Morning.

08:03.260 --> 08:04.920
Wh-What is this?

08:06.460 --> 08:08.600
Thirty-two.

08:08.600 --> 08:10.300
Thirty-three.

08:11.690 --> 08:13.370
You shouldn't talk to him.

08:13.370 --> 08:15.050
Don't get in his way.

08:15.050 --> 08:17.100
Wh-What is he doing?

08:17.100 --> 08:18.960
He's counting coffee beans.

08:20.630 --> 08:25.310
It seems Senpai isn't content
until he has exactly 60 beans.

08:25.310 --> 08:28.330
Bottoms up to Senpai's perfect cup, yo.

08:31.950 --> 08:35.960
Was it really 60 coffee beans, though?

08:35.960 --> 08:36.820
Huh?

08:37.490 --> 08:39.170
I've been wondering, too.

08:39.170 --> 08:40.720
Wasn't it 100 beans?

08:40.720 --> 08:43.160
If Senpai says it's 60, then it's 60.

08:43.160 --> 08:44.750
Wasn't it 50?

08:44.750 --> 08:45.510
Ninety?

08:45.510 --> 08:46.550
Sixty.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.300
What time is it?

08:48.300 --> 08:49.530
8:05.

08:49.530 --> 08:50.500
It's 50.

08:50.860 --> 08:52.140
5:05, huh?

08:52.140 --> 08:53.150
8:00!

08:53.150 --> 08:54.150
Sixty!

08:54.150 --> 08:55.090
6:00, huh?

08:55.090 --> 08:55.980
Eight!

08:55.980 --> 08:56.600
Five!

08:56.600 --> 08:57.290
Six!

08:57.290 --> 08:57.970
Five?

09:02.850 --> 09:04.690
Stop saying numbers!

09:05.060 --> 09:08.600
I've lost count of my beans!

09:12.020 --> 09:13.840
I'm not giving up.

09:14.290 --> 09:17.320
Fate exists to be overcome.

09:18.590 --> 09:20.080
Yum.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.320
Brilliant.

09:21.320 --> 09:22.100
See?

09:22.100 --> 09:23.910
Instant is good enough.

09:23.910 --> 09:25.470
And it's inexpensive.

09:26.370 --> 09:28.960
Fourteen, fifteen...

09:32.300 --> 09:34.630
Eighteen, nineteen...

09:36.920 --> 09:38.140
Twenty-one...

09:41.650 --> 09:43.090
Twenty...

09:46.250 --> 09:49.860
F-F-Fifty-nine...

09:50.100 --> 09:54.610
S-S-S-S-S-S-Sixty.

09:57.160 --> 09:59.070
I've finally done it! Sixty beans!

09:59.070 --> 10:00.480
And now I can finally enjoy it.

10:00.480 --> 10:03.700
Just wait for me, my best coffee!

10:06.150 --> 10:08.770
No, it's too soon to get excited.

10:08.770 --> 10:12.070
There is still the final test.

10:21.670 --> 10:22.550
I knew it.

10:22.900 --> 10:24.730
Coming through.

10:25.300 --> 10:27.280
Born in Vienna, raised on hip-hop.

10:27.280 --> 10:29.270
We're probably buddies, if you're a vagabond.

10:30.770 --> 10:33.560
Thus is the nature of fate.

10:33.560 --> 10:34.980
I'm well aware.

10:35.940 --> 10:37.840
But I will never relent.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.660
There is a way!

10:41.190 --> 10:42.490
Now!

10:48.030 --> 10:49.450
Take that, losers.

10:49.450 --> 10:50.270
It's mine.

10:50.270 --> 10:52.270
My best coffee!

10:52.270 --> 10:53.630
<i>There</i> it is.

10:54.530 --> 10:56.880
Crap, I'm going to crash!

10:57.880 --> 10:58.920
Not yet.

10:58.920 --> 11:01.180
I shall prevail.

11:01.790 --> 11:05.060
My beloved best coffee!

11:09.570 --> 11:13.110
I have sixty beans!

11:23.720 --> 11:24.740
Delicious.

11:24.740 --> 11:25.890
Too delicious.

11:25.890 --> 11:27.290
How could it taste so?

11:27.290 --> 11:30.280
No, it's not just the flavor.

11:30.280 --> 11:31.570
I overcame many a tribulation.

11:31.570 --> 11:33.250
I opened the path to my own fate.

11:33.250 --> 11:35.220
I earned this coffee with my own hands.

11:35.220 --> 11:37.720
This is why it tickles my heart so.

11:38.760 --> 11:41.470
S-So this is what they call coffee.

11:41.470 --> 11:42.740
Magnificent.

11:42.740 --> 11:44.370
No, it could be said that,

11:44.370 --> 11:47.000
as I was the one who discovered
it, pursued it and acquired it,

11:47.000 --> 11:49.480
<i>I</i> am the most magnificent of all.

11:52.870 --> 11:54.220
Hey, hey, Lud-kun.

11:56.040 --> 11:58.610
I found this bean on the floor.

12:06.180 --> 12:08.410
Did I say something bad?

12:11.230 --> 12:11.800
Lud-kun!

12:11.950 --> 12:13.350
Lud-kun!

12:18.680 --> 12:21.960
Come on, Lud-kun, what's wrong?

12:24.390 --> 12:25.090
What?

12:25.090 --> 12:26.220
Why did you throw it out?

12:26.220 --> 12:27.710
What a waste.

12:27.710 --> 12:29.770
It was good, though, wasn't it?

12:29.770 --> 12:32.190
I-It means nothing.

12:32.190 --> 12:33.850
There must be sixty beans.

12:33.850 --> 12:35.670
But wasn't it good?

12:35.670 --> 12:37.560
It doesn't matter how it tastes!

12:37.840 --> 12:42.030
Listen, I don't necessarily
want to drink tasty coffee.

12:42.030 --> 12:46.230
What I want is to drink exactly sixty beans!

12:50.890 --> 12:53.750
No, I seriously don't get it.

12:58.810 --> 13:00.710
I'm not buying that guy anything again.

13:02.410 --> 13:03.660
Why?

13:03.660 --> 13:06.800
Why are people so quick to compromise?

13:07.290 --> 13:09.840
"It was good, though, wasn't it?" You say?

13:09.840 --> 13:10.780
Nonsense.

13:10.780 --> 13:14.060
For everything in the
world, there is a "best."

13:14.340 --> 13:17.510
That goes even for this stroll.

13:17.510 --> 13:20.940
It may appear casual, but it
follows an ultimate route.

13:21.150 --> 13:23.690
It is my best stroll.

13:24.300 --> 13:25.980
I turn right here,

13:25.980 --> 13:29.520
and walk straight as I gaze at the
slightly oddly-shaped persimmon tree.

13:29.520 --> 13:33.120
Then, without fail, I pass by
a master of flower arrangement.

13:33.460 --> 13:36.080
I bow at an angle of 22 degrees.

13:37.100 --> 13:38.840
The best.

13:38.840 --> 13:41.930
Good, Beethoven. Good, master.

13:41.930 --> 13:44.010
Compare that to those<i> people...</i>

13:44.200 --> 13:48.430
Those integrity-lacking
hacks of human beings.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.010
That's right.

13:51.270 --> 13:53.770
It's that location!

13:53.770 --> 13:57.110
I've obtained the best beans
and the best bean count.

13:57.110 --> 14:04.070
But I have yet to achieve the best
location to enjoy the ultimate coffee.

14:05.630 --> 14:06.950
Now that that's clear...

14:07.420 --> 14:08.660
I searched.

14:09.000 --> 14:09.950
And searched.

14:10.190 --> 14:11.120
And searched.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.010
And searched.

14:12.140 --> 14:12.850
And searched.

14:12.980 --> 14:14.120
And searched.

14:14.600 --> 14:18.830
And I finally found my best position.

14:19.550 --> 14:21.490
Th-This is it.

14:30.260 --> 14:31.680
Perfection.

14:31.680 --> 14:33.470
Not a single complaint.

14:33.470 --> 14:34.720
Perfect.

14:35.220 --> 14:37.870
Coffee, made with sixty beans.

14:37.870 --> 14:40.560
And this perfect chair.

14:40.560 --> 14:41.810
Spinal angle.

14:42.180 --> 14:43.020
Rocking intensity.

14:43.290 --> 14:44.320
Hand position.

14:44.680 --> 14:46.690
Not a single thing is off.

14:47.300 --> 14:48.530
The best!

14:55.370 --> 14:57.680
Now, time to enjoy it.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.600
Sorry, mister.

15:02.600 --> 15:04.000
Are you okay?

15:05.960 --> 15:07.500
Aw, it's a panda.

15:07.500 --> 15:08.380
I want to ride it.

15:08.570 --> 15:10.550
Let me on.

15:18.890 --> 15:20.870
What's going on?

15:20.870 --> 15:22.080
Just come here, hurry.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.710
This is bad.

15:23.710 --> 15:24.650
What's going on?

15:24.650 --> 15:26.780
I'm so excited.

15:26.780 --> 15:28.940
Come on, mister.

15:29.390 --> 15:30.580
Don't be so mean.

15:30.580 --> 15:31.590
Move over.

15:31.590 --> 15:33.320
It's for kids to play on.

15:33.800 --> 15:34.560
Are you listening?

15:34.560 --> 15:35.390
Come on, mister.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.580
Move.

15:36.900 --> 15:37.850
Why won't you move?

15:37.850 --> 15:39.560
How many times must I tell you?

15:39.560 --> 15:40.900
I won't move.

15:40.900 --> 15:42.920
I want this panda.

15:42.920 --> 15:44.630
Go use the bunny or the turtle.

15:44.630 --> 15:45.940
Unbelievable.

15:45.940 --> 15:48.130
The best is the panda.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.260
Dear, oh, dear.

15:50.260 --> 15:52.370
Children are so stubborn.

15:52.370 --> 15:53.800
Such unreasonable creatures.

15:53.800 --> 15:55.570
Get off of there.

15:55.570 --> 15:56.780
What are you doing?

15:56.780 --> 15:58.450
Are you a kid?

15:58.450 --> 15:59.100
Well?

15:59.100 --> 15:59.530
Well?

15:59.530 --> 16:00.050
Well?

16:00.050 --> 16:01.390
Well?

16:01.390 --> 16:02.130
Well?

16:02.130 --> 16:03.270
Well?

16:02.290 --> 16:04.920
Beethes-san, this is too much.

16:03.270 --> 16:04.940
Well?

16:04.920 --> 16:06.640
They're elementary school kids.

16:04.940 --> 16:06.670
Well?

16:06.640 --> 16:09.550
Come on, Senpai, let's back down for now.

16:06.670 --> 16:08.340
Well?

16:08.340 --> 16:09.520
Well?

16:09.520 --> 16:10.820
Well?

16:09.550 --> 16:10.790
Want me to call the police?

16:10.790 --> 16:12.070
We should do it soon.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.070
Well?

16:12.270 --> 16:13.540
So are you?

16:20.730 --> 16:21.620
All right.

16:21.620 --> 16:22.810
I'll move.

16:34.780 --> 16:35.880
So...

16:35.880 --> 16:37.220
Move, please.

16:39.210 --> 16:39.710
Hey.

16:39.710 --> 16:40.710
Hurry.

16:40.710 --> 16:41.850
Yes, yes.

16:41.850 --> 16:43.140
No, don't, "Yes, yes," me.

16:43.140 --> 16:44.420
Move!

16:44.420 --> 16:45.410
Yes, yes.

16:45.410 --> 16:47.250
Don't, "Yes, yes," me.

16:52.380 --> 16:53.300
What the hell?

16:53.300 --> 16:54.570
Move, now!

16:54.570 --> 16:56.830
My best position!

16:57.280 --> 16:58.790
Forget it.

16:59.650 --> 17:01.270
Fine, mister.

17:01.270 --> 17:04.080
You can fight us for it,
if you want it <i>that</i> badly.

17:06.550 --> 17:09.310
Now, if you lose in this game of dodgeball,

17:09.310 --> 17:11.760
you never get to sit on that panda again.

17:12.130 --> 17:13.410
It's a promise.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.260
Don't you underestimate me, children.

17:16.570 --> 17:19.670
Even if you should all gather against me,

17:19.670 --> 17:22.510
you'll never defeat the genius that I am.

17:23.110 --> 17:24.560
Prepare yourselves.

17:25.210 --> 17:28.570
Obviously, I'm going to be on this team.

17:28.570 --> 17:30.980
Damn you, Landlady, you've betrayed me!

17:30.980 --> 17:31.660
Me, too.

17:31.660 --> 17:32.460
Wolf!

17:32.460 --> 17:33.190
Me, too.

17:33.190 --> 17:33.930
Boy!

17:33.930 --> 17:34.720
Me, too.

17:34.720 --> 17:36.740
You... But I took care of you!

17:38.050 --> 17:40.480
No, I see you, Schubert-kun.

17:40.480 --> 17:41.210
Disappointing.

17:41.210 --> 17:43.160
Utterly disappointing.

17:45.090 --> 17:45.870
Is he mental?

17:45.870 --> 17:46.880
That one stings!

17:46.880 --> 17:48.250
What's your problem?

17:49.140 --> 17:50.090
But...

17:50.830 --> 17:53.330
This is one-on-ten.

17:53.330 --> 17:54.350
Fifteen?

17:54.350 --> 17:56.590
This is unfair.

17:59.130 --> 18:00.180
But I like it.

18:00.960 --> 18:04.580
As I've said many times,
this is the nature of life.

18:04.580 --> 18:07.350
Fate exists to be overcome.

18:08.560 --> 18:10.340
I shall defeat you.

18:10.340 --> 18:14.250
And I shall take my best chair!

18:22.880 --> 18:23.960
Once more.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.710
What? That's not how it works.

18:27.210 --> 18:28.580
Once more!

18:29.170 --> 18:31.550
F-Fine, I guess.

18:31.550 --> 18:33.870
Not that it'll make a difference.

18:34.610 --> 18:36.470
That's the spirit.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.300
Once more!

18:41.670 --> 18:42.600
Again!

19:04.440 --> 19:07.200
H-He finally gave up.

19:11.470 --> 19:12.890
Not yet.

19:12.890 --> 19:15.790
I haven't given up yet.

19:15.790 --> 19:16.710
Come.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.680
Symbol!

19:22.450 --> 19:25.100
Guys, let's go home.

19:25.100 --> 19:26.180
Oy...

19:26.180 --> 19:29.610
Go sit on the panda, if you love it so much.

19:30.040 --> 19:30.690
Bye.

19:30.970 --> 19:31.970
Oy...

19:31.970 --> 19:34.210
Stop! Are you running away?

19:34.210 --> 19:35.110
Oy.

19:35.110 --> 19:37.270
Oy!

19:45.430 --> 19:47.190
Victory through persistence.

19:47.190 --> 19:48.700
Thank you, everybody.

19:48.700 --> 19:49.930
My best chair.

19:49.930 --> 19:51.260
My best game.

20:15.440 --> 20:18.690
Ladies and gentlemen, it is a fine morning.

20:18.880 --> 20:22.590
Yesterday's victory still
resonates within me.

20:23.620 --> 20:25.520
Refreshing indeed.

20:27.450 --> 20:30.460
Now, I will begin this perfect day

20:30.460 --> 20:33.670
with my magnificent Musik.

20:34.710 --> 20:41.050
Spielen wir unsere Musik!

20:41.050 --> 20:45.290
This moment, I...

20:45.290 --> 20:49.520
Sweet fruit of dreams

20:49.520 --> 20:53.850
Ripening on the branches

20:53.850 --> 20:57.020
I take into my mouth

20:57.470 --> 21:05.240
Bright eyes, burning in the sunlight

21:05.790 --> 21:23.090
But now it has melted into the sea
of memories and become a gentle wave

21:23.090 --> 21:27.090
Glistening, flowing

21:27.090 --> 21:32.470
Let the fruit melt into this sea

21:32.470 --> 21:36.020
Glistening, flowing

21:36.740 --> 21:41.230
Taking to my heart

21:41.230 --> 21:47.200
That beautiful summer past

21:53.250 --> 21:55.080
Huh? What?

21:55.400 --> 21:57.360
That man isn't here today?

21:57.360 --> 21:59.020
No, he's here.

21:59.020 --> 22:03.380
Ladies and gentlemen, I must ask
you to contemplate something.

22:03.380 --> 22:09.280
What is the greatest sport in the world?

22:09.280 --> 22:11.290
You can take plenty of time to answer.

22:11.290 --> 22:13.890
Think it over carefully.

22:13.890 --> 22:16.030
Is that what you expected me to say?

22:16.030 --> 22:18.980
The answer is dodgeball!

22:19.170 --> 22:20.850
Dodgeball is the most entertaining.

22:20.850 --> 22:21.600
Fun.

22:21.600 --> 22:22.600
Exciting.

22:22.600 --> 22:26.950
Now, play dodgeball with this fine gentleman!

22:27.330 --> 22:31.700
Throw that ball at me!

22:41.790 --> 22:44.800
To be continued

24:14.760 --> 24:29.780
The World of Eight Sounds: Part 1

24:15.130 --> 24:17.020
Hear the footsteps of doom.

24:17.020 --> 24:21.160
Unwavering, unrelenting, my heart
dances toward a single goal.

24:21.160 --> 24:22.350
Energy fills my blood.

24:22.660 --> 24:26.480
Seeking purity, raising my
knees, tapping my heels,

24:26.480 --> 24:28.190
pursuing even greater heights.
